'''Orange Marble''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is orange in color with a marble texture, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black. 

== Trivia ==
*It has a green variant from the following year under the name [[Green Marble]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Marble Set|Marble Set]].
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event box ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*As of the [[Easter Event 2023]], a new white [[Marble]] knife has been released.

